---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Frequently asked questions about ESPR, Digital Product Passports, and our platform.",
};
---

<Layout title="FAQ" {seo}>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
    <h2>What is the ESPR?</h2>
    <p>The Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation (ESPR) is a framework by the EU to improve product circularity. It mandates a Digital Product Passport for regulated products.</p>
    <h2>When do cables need a DPP?</h2>
    <p>Cables are targeted for the second wave of ESPR implementation, currently estimated for 2026-2027, prioritizing high-voltage power cables first.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
